The notice above covers every file in this directory. They are derived from the
Open Industry Project (https://github.com/Open-Industry-Project/Open-Industry-Project):

  six-axis.glb, *six-axis-*.webp   assets/3DModels/Six-axis/
  eoat-suction.glb, eoat-*.webp    assets/3DModels/EOATSuction/
  wall-braced.glb                  assets/3DModels/WallsAndRoof/Wall_A.glb
  wall-plain.glb                   assets/3DModels/WallsAndRoof/Wall_D.glb
  roof.glb                         assets/3DModels/WallsAndRoof/Roof_A.glb
  floor-tile.glb                   assets/3DModels/WallsAndRoof/Floor.glb
  light.glb                        assets/3DModels/WallsAndRoof/Light_A.glb
  wall_01-*, framing_0*-*,         assets/3DModels/WallsAndRoof/Textures/
  roof_01-*, floor_a-*, light_a-*
  pallet.glb                       assets/3DModels/Pallet.glb
  agv.glb                          assets/3DModels/AGV/AGV.glb

Modifications, in full: four unused vertex attributes were removed from every
GLB and their buffers repacked; embedded textures were resampled and re-encoded
as WebP; external texture sets were resampled and re-encoded as WebP. No
geometry was altered — no vertex moved, welded, decimated or re-indexed, and
every triangle count is unchanged. The build is reproducible with
scripts/build-robot-model.mjs. Full detail in THIRD_PARTY_ASSETS.md at the
repository root.
